{
 "title": "Purchasing an Item",
 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html\n  SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\" dir=\"ltr\"><head><title>Purchasing an Item</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"After you find the items or services you need, add them to your cart and submit the request for approval.\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"After you find the items or services you need, add them to your cart and submit the request for approval.\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\" href=\"/resource/css/style-v2.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"js/sap-strings.js\"></script></head><body class=\"en-us sap-light centered navigation-default enumeration-disabled collapsify-enabled\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-container\" class=\"container_12\" role=\"application\"><div id=\"d4h5-section-container\" class=\"grid_12\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-content\" class=\"grid_8 alpha omega\"><section><div class=\"page task  - topic-topic task-task \" id=\"loiobc4029647db14165abbe86f78aedd6ec\"><h1 class=\"title topictitle1\">Purchasing an Item</h1><div class=\"body taskbody\"><p class=\"shortdesc\">After you find the items or services you need, add them to your cart and submit the\nrequest for approval.</p>\n<div class=\"section context\"><span id=\"steps\" class=\"anchor\"></span><div class=\"tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Context</h2></div><p class=\"p\">The following video demonstrates the buying process in guided buying. You can\nplay the interactive tutorial for step-by-step instructions; all tutorials are\ncaptioned exclusively in English:</p><p class=\"p\">\n<a class=\"xref\" href=\"https://education.hana.ondemand.com/education/wa/aribanc/%7Etag/published/index.html?show=project!PR_882580D7DBDA878C:uebung#TS_A04FFFD4C94A4B73A632C74B6E7B55B7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://education.hana.ondemand.com/education/wa/aribanc/%7Etag/published/index.html?show=project!PR_882580D7DBDA878C:uebung#TS_A04FFFD4C94A4B73A632C74B6E7B55B7\" title=\"https://education.hana.ondemand.com/education/wa/aribanc/%7Etag/published/index.html?show=project!PR_882580D7DBDA878C:uebung#TS_A04FFFD4C94A4B73A632C74B6E7B55B7\">\n<img class=\"inline\" id=\"loiobc4029647db14165abbe86f78aedd6ec__image_v4l_kps_fyb\" src=\"loio5920b64e0c0141bfb654dbffb1753901_LowRes.png\" alt=\"Select anywhere within the image element to play the video.\" title=\"Select anywhere within the image element to play the video.\"></a></p>After all the items are in your cart, select the\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Check out</span> button to start the purchase request, as shown in\nthe following figure.<p class=\"p\"><img class=\"inline\" id=\"loiobc4029647db14165abbe86f78aedd6ec__image_qgt_ky4_2yb\" src=\"loio5cbbda6fb25b4e39b505087f66a0b461_LowRes.jpg\" alt=\"Clicking the shopping cart icon at the top allows you to review the items and click check out.\" title=\"Clicking the shopping cart icon at the top allows you to review the items and click check out.\"></p>After you select <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Check out</span>, items from your cart\npopulate into a purchase requisition. You must complete the request before it can be\nsubmitted for approval. The checkout page verifies information against your site's\npolicies; therefore, incorrect details or selections result in warnings or errors. The\nfollowing figure displays an error message displays at line-level.<p class=\"p\"><img class=\"inline\" id=\"loiobc4029647db14165abbe86f78aedd6ec__image_w2y_fnp_g1c\" src=\"loio0784ba3618064c37913cdb61adc69eb5_LowRes.jpg\" alt=\"This item contains missing or incorrect information.\" title=\"This item contains missing or incorrect information.\"></p>You must resolve all the errors before you can submit a request. For\nmore information on resolving errors and warnings, see <a class=\"xref\" href=\"163dcbeca7ec42f89a8c49303f64acf4.html\" title=\"Purchasing policies implemented by your organization may cause warnings or errors to appear when you create a request.\">Warnings and Errors on Requests</a>.</div>\n<section class=\"section procedure\"><span id=\"steps\" class=\"anchor\"></span><div class=\"ol steps tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Procedure</h2></div><ol class=\"ol steps\"><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Add a brief summary of your request to the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Title</span> field,\nas shown in the following figure.</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<p class=\"p\"><img class=\"inline\" id=\"loiobc4029647db14165abbe86f78aedd6ec__image_txc_d1p_g1c\" src=\"loio5f973b8ba150437d824cf6b95694041e_LowRes.jpg\" alt=\"The submit button is activated once a title is provided and details are finalized.\" title=\"The submit button is activated once a title is provided and details are finalized.\"></p>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">In the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Items</span> section, open the dropdown menu and adjust\nline-item information as needed, as shown in the following figure.</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<p class=\"p\"><img class=\"inline\" id=\"loiobc4029647db14165abbe86f78aedd6ec__image_wwz_hfp_2yb\" src=\"loio5a8441773eb5494388ebf8f51766f8f4_LowRes.jpg\" alt=\"Accounting, shipping, comments, attachments, and others are the sections for each line item.\" title=\"Accounting, shipping, comments, attachments, and others are the sections for each line item.\"></p>\n<p class=\"p\">For more information about the sections in each line-item, see the\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Related information</span> section following this\nprocedure.</p>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">If available, click <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Validate</span> to check for warnings or\nerrors.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Review the approval flow and if needed, you can add or remove users.</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<p class=\"p\">If the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Refresh to update</span> window displays when you edit\nthe approval flow, you must refresh the flow before making edits.</p>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\"><span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">To save the request</span>, click <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Save and\nexit</span>.</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup stepresult\">\n<p class=\"p\">The request is saved in <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Composing</span> status.</p>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\"><span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">To submit the request</span>, click <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Submit</span>\nand it's submitted for approval.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\"><span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">To withdraw the request</span>, click\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Withdraw</span>, which saves it in\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Composing</span> state.</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<p class=\"p\">If you delete all the items on the request, the entire request is deleted and\nyou're taken back to the home page.</p>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\"><span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">After you submit the request</span>, navigate to <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Your\nRequests</span> to check the status. For more information, see <a class=\"xref\" href=\"77dcef906e6947eb947524bf5cb07434.html\" title=\"You can check the status of your requests to see when they're fully approved, or to find out when you'll receive the items or service. You can also find the request history to find if the order was sent to the supplier.\">Finding the Status of Your Requests</a>.</span>\n</li></ol></section>\n</div><div class=\"related-links\"> <div class=\"relinfo\"><div class=\"relinfotitle \">Related Information</div><div><a class=\"link\" href=\"c39461df451d4438ab5daaa3d18c51fc.html\" title=\"In the Accounting section of purchase requisitions, information about who is billed for the purchase and other cost-related details are available.\">Accounting</a></div><div><a class=\"link\" href=\"5636f9b6197249ae8e61db9a11ab40c9.html\" title=\"In the Shipping section for each item in your purchase request, you can change the plant address, need-by date, deliver-to address, or purchase group, if allowed by your organization.\">Shipping</a></div><div><a class=\"link\" href=\"fb22c60f44b04b55b379e18d18e5d574.html\" title=\"In the Comments section of purchase requisitions, you can add comments and allow suppliers to see your comments.\">Comments</a></div><div><a class=\"link\" href=\"636d16c266764b74b39c0444e3936139.html\" title=\"In the Attachments section of purchase requisitions, you can add attachments at header-level or line-level.\">Attachments</a></div><div><a class=\"link\" href=\"1698f43fcec34afbb6396faa4881051b.html\" title=\"In the Others section of purchase requisitions, additional information such as, subcontractor or classification details can be changed.\">Others</a></div> <?sap-ot O2O class=\"- topic/link \" href=\"b46f64c64a01492ab736f89932ecf0a3.xml\" text=\"\" desc=\"\" xtrc=\"link:6\" xtrf=\"file:/home/builder/src/dita-all/bwd1771455060365/loioa50ade649ecd478ba2f086d9a7be387c_en-US/src/content/localization/en-us/bc4029647db14165abbe86f78aedd6ec.xml\" output-class=\"link\" outputTopicFile=\"file:/home/builder/tp.net.sf.dita-ot/2.3/plugins/org.dita4publishers.html5/xsl/map2html5Content.xsl\" > </div></div></div></section><div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div></div></div></body></html>"
}